# A field beneath _ in the source.
-- source.cue --
x: _
-- target.cue --
y: int
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {y: v0_0.x.y}
-- out --
not total
v1_0.y copies v0_0.x.y, which may be absent: v0_0.x is _ in the source schema, which need not hold y (rule source-absent) @ lens.cue:2:11
  help: write the field under if v0_0.x.y != _|_
v1_0.y copies v0_0.x.y, which is now int, which does not accept every value of the prior _ (rule copy-narrowed) @ lens.cue:2:11
